with the theory of relativity, this corresponds to only two subjective years (time as experienced by those within the spacecraft).\n\nThe two of them had lost their parents when they were young and the bond between the two is very close. It is Sara’s dearest wish to be reunited with her brother. To do that, she must travel to the battlefield where he is.\n\nOne day, Sara’s planet is suddenly assaulted by Deague forces. To her surprise, her brother, Ralph, turns out to be one of the raiders who successfully kidnap a mysterious girl sleeping in a capsule.\n\nIn order to find the truth, Sara gets in a Strain and chases after him. However, she is attacked by Ralph, and the Mimic, a copy of the pilot’s brain which is essential to controlling the Strain, is damaged.\n\n(Source: AnimeNfo)"},"tags":[{"name":"Real Robot","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Space","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"War","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Nudity","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Bullying","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Manipulation","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Yuri","rank":54,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"STRAIN: Strategic Armored Infantry","english":"STRAIN: Strategic Armored Infantry","native":"奏光のストレイン","romaji":"Soukou no Strain","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"奏光之Strain"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"奏光的Strain"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"走光的便当王"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}